This is not a sound file. It is its name.

Two seconds of triumph, assigned by default to almost nothing, and therefore
heard mostly by people testing their speakers in the Sounds control panel,
clicking the little arrow, over and over, while deciding whether the machine
worked.

It is also what you heard when somebody else's machine finished doing
something, three desks away, in an office where every machine announced
itself.

Nothing here will play it. See README.TXT in this folder.
